


Mmemme njikwa-ebe-nchekwa: 0.

>> x := 0.
>> y := ['Hello'].
>> q := { ['Empty']. }.
>> p := Eziokwu.
>> a := Ndepụta ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 4.

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Mmemme hichaa.
usedMemory1 := (Mmemme ebe-nchekwa ? 0).




